# Branding

Vantera is white-label. Every client-facing surface is branded to the business.

## "Vantera" must NEVER appear in:
- Any file inside `app/(portal)/`
- Any email template
- Any SMS template body
- Any `<title>` rendered to a contact
- Any default value for business name, logo, or color

## Always source brand values from the branding context

```tsx
// ✅ Client component
const { businessName, primaryColor, logoUrl } = useBranding()

// ✅ Server component
const branding = getBrandingFromHeaders(headers())
```

# AI Output Rules

- **Team plan**: Claude output is NEVER sent to contacts without template wrapping or human review.
- **Enterprise plan**: Autonomous send only when `evaluateFlag('autonomous_ai_messaging') === true`.
- Never log Claude responses that contain contact PII.
